# Three boxes in one column. A -> B has a box in its way: the router connects them side to side
# down the free gutter (two bends) instead of snaking around X. Force `A:bottom -> B:top` to compare.
node A "Source"
node X "Middle" below A
node B "Sink" below X

edge A -> X "first"
edge X -> B "second"
edge A -> B "skip"
